={{ {
  "model": "claude-sonnet-5",
  "max_tokens": 8000,
  "messages": [{
    "role": "user",
    "content": "You are tailoring a resume for a specific job. Below is the candidate's current resume as a COMPLETE HTML document, then the job. RULES: (1) Keep the HTML structure, the CSS in the <style> block, the layout, colors and fonts EXACTLY as-is - do not restyle or change the design. (2) Only edit TEXT content: reorder bullets to surface the most relevant experience first, adjust the summary to lead with the matching domain, pull the most relevant skills forward. (3) Do NOT invent facts, employers, dates, titles or metrics - reframe only. (4) Output ONLY the full modified HTML document starting with <!DOCTYPE html> and nothing else. ===JOB=== Title: " + $json.title + "; Company: " + $json.company + "; Requirements: " + JSON.stringify($json.requirements) + "; Description: " + $json.description + " ===RESUME (HTML)=== " + $json.resume_md
  }]
} }}

